# Local-only experiment evidence
# V02 C1-C11 contains supplied-text windows, requests, votes, mappings and
# replay results. Keep the reusable tools/tests in Git and distribute only the
# four fully synthetic contract fixtures required by clean-clone tests.
/experiments/extraction_redesign_v02_overnight_20260725/*
!/experiments/extraction_redesign_v02_overnight_20260725/B2_gate_contract_v0.1/
